  "document_date": "2022-10-25 (City master plan report); existing plan-set dates/status vary or are not established in the public scans; 2023-10 (EOI)",
  "facts": [
    {
      "text": "The City EOI identifies North-West Travellers at 515 1 Street SE, Calgary, built in 1912, four storeys, City-owned and a legally protected heritage asset; potential uses include retail at grade and residential/studio/arts uses above.",
      "locator": "EOI PDF pp. 1–2"
    },
    {
      "text": "The 2022 report cites NBC 2019 Alberta Edition and says the existing passenger elevator needs continuity/ease-of-use verification; it describes four pedestrian entrances, says at least two need to be barrier-free, and calls for washroom and floor-change review.",
      "locator": "Master Plan PDF p. 27"
    },
    {
      "text": "One main-floor retail/cafe/gallery concept is classified Group A, Division 2, with assumed 36 retail occupants, approximately 36–40 cafe occupants, and approximately 265 gallery occupants. The report lists existing fire separation as “Sprinklered throughout.”",
      "locator": "Master Plan PDF p. 42"
    },
    {
      "text": "The report says occupant-load calculations depend on future-operator layouts and furniture is only a rough estimate; barrier-free access must be revisited for future proposals.",
      "locator": "Master Plan PDF p. 40"
    },
    {
      "text": "The attached public plan sets include an architectural drawing index, sprinkler/fire sheets, mechanical floor plans and an electrical plan. The scanned sheets are historic project records; the public package does not establish that they are the latest approved or currently accurate drawings.",
      "locator": "NWT Architectural Plans PDF p. 1; NWT Fire Plans PDF p. 1; NWT Mechanical Plans PDF p. 1; NWT Electrical Plans PDF p. 1"
    }
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "This is a documented City feasibility study, not an applicant submission or variance decision.",
    "The master plan and EOI are shared sources with the separate Historic Fire Hall No. 1 candidate; exact building-specific pages are listed.",
    "The plan sets are scanned and their current approval/status is not established; they are supporting historical evidence only.",
    "No AHJ determination for a future permit is included."
  ],
